    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d839">

                <pb facs="0725" n="715" xml:id="pg715"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.936/9–3049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Strong</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of state </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canton</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-30T09:00:00+08:00">September 30,
                            1949—9 a. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 1—9:10 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cantel 1150. Reference telCan 704, September 28, repeated Taipei 344. We made
                    almost identical verbal explanation to Foreign Office September 23. Foreign
                    Office apparently satisfied.</p>
                <p>Sent Department; repeated Taipei 178.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Strong</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
